abstract: >-
  A source-linked research atlas of three American Alchemy conversations with
  Jason Reza Jorjani, plus documentary comparisons. Edition 9 records 2,229
  entities, 2,271 attributed claims, and 259 document records. Interview
  statements stay attributed. Documentary citations do not authenticate
  extraordinary allegations. Ninety spoken-name targets remain audio-unverified.
keywords:
  - research atlas
  - knowledge graph
  - source criticism
  - American Alchemy
  - Jason Reza Jorjani
